pr.body:
This fixes a failure with the doc build on main that was accidentally introduced with #29288 (see comment https://github.com/scikit-learn/scikit-learn/pull/29288#issuecomment-2598701450).

Also, the PR makes `class_likelihood_ratios` use the new param when it's indirectly used in the scoring, so that users don't get the `FutureWarning`, when they have no control about it.

@lesteve @adrinjalali

